@title: home_navigation
@context: Every link on the home page leads to its page, and Home leads back.
@tags: navigation
@import: * from '../lib/env.hunt'

STEP 1: Open home
    NAVIGATE to 'Home'
    VERIFY that the page is 'Home'

STEP 2: The login page
    CLICK the 'Login page' link
    VERIFY that the page is 'Login'

STEP 3: Back home
    CLICK the 'Home' link
    VERIFY that the page is 'Home'

STEP 4: The sign-up form
    CLICK the 'Sign-up form' link
    VERIFY that the page is 'Signup'

STEP 5: The slow page
    CLICK the 'Home' link
    CLICK the 'Slow page' link
    VERIFY that the page is 'Slow page'

STEP 6: Mouse and keyboard
    CLICK the 'Home' link
    CLICK the 'Mouse and keyboard' link
    VERIFY that the page is 'Mouse and keyboard'

STEP 7: The quote of the day
    CLICK the 'Home' link
    CLICK the 'Quote of the day' link
    VERIFY that the page is 'Quotes'

STEP 8: Home once more
    CLICK the 'Home' link
    VERIFY that the page is 'Home'

DONE.
